exact revision.

Ported implementation families:
- src/chains.ts and src/client.ts: sugar/chains.py and its related modules.
- src/config.ts and src/known-tokens.ts: sugar/config.py.
- src/helpers.ts: sugar/helpers.py and sugar/quote.py.
- src/models.ts and src/types.ts: sugar/pool.py, sugar/position.py,
  sugar/token.py, sugar/price.py, sugar/deposit.py, sugar/withdraw.py,
  sugar/quote.py and sugar/config.py.
- src/planner.ts: sugar/swap.py.
- src/superswap.ts: sugar/superswap.py.
- src/actions.ts and original CLI behavior: sugar/cli.py.
- src/abis.ts and original ABI artifacts: sugar/abi.py and sugar/abis/.

